 "remarks": "Bring your imagination and make this wonderful 1 bedroom, 1 bath unit your own. Winnipauk Village features beautiful grounds, 2 pools, a kiddie pool, clubhouse, gym and pickleball courts. Pet friendly complex. HOA fee breakdown is $156 for general HOA (water & sewer is included) and $105 for the SSD (special services district) making a total HOA monthly fee of $261. One reserved parking space and plenty of unreserved spaces. Complex was recently paved, new fiberoptic was installed, new siding, roof and decks. New refrigerator, bathroom was remodeled in 2022, HVAC replaced in 2008 and sliders in 2012. Special assessment is paid off. 234 units, roughly 29 are reported as investor owned. Owner must live there for 1 year before renting. Schedule your private showing today in this very well managed association.",
